调&amp;quot;随月盈亏调刺数&amp;quot;和&amp;quot;左病取右&amp;quot;的治疗法则。</description></item><item><title>咳论篇第三十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE38%E5%92%B3%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE38%E5%92%B3%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯系统论述五脏六腑咳症的病因病机、症状特点及针刺疗法，揭示&amp;quot;五脏六腑皆令人咳&amp;quot;的病理机制，强调&amp;quot;咳症传变规律&amp;quot;和&amp;quot;辨证取穴&amp;quot;的治疗原则。</description></item></channel></rss>